  trackable: 0
  loreSource: "Under a flowerpot"
  loreText: "The oven stone has grown something. It's black in the middle and it eats the lamplight, I watched it. I called it the Maw Jaw as a joke and now Dr. Marrow has written it on the label, so I suppose that's its name. I've stopped going in there for biscuits."
